From 513876eaebf2066cbc56c9a0e545f0694d058876 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Coredex <samdhi2323@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:49:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] kotlinc: one backend thread

Kotlin's parallel JVM code generation (-Xbackend-threads=0) intermittently fails with an
ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException in JvmIrCodegenFactory.invokeCodegen (ArrayList.add from worker
threads). Single-threaded codegen is deterministic; it only costs some build time.
---
 config/cli/kotlinc.args | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/config/cli/kotlinc.args b/config/cli/kotlinc.args
index 69dc398..f5db5d8 100644
--- a/config/cli/kotlinc.args
+++ b/config/cli/kotlinc.args
@@ -7,5 +7,5 @@
 -Xno-param-assertions
 -Xno-receiver-assertions
 -Xreport-perf
--Xbackend-threads=0
+-Xbackend-threads=1
 -verbose
\ No newline at end of file
